  "description": "The native payload for Agora's AI noise suppression extension (ains 4.6.3 on Maven Central), packaged for .NET for Android. Removes background noise from the captured microphone stream with a neural model, well beyond what the engine's built-in suppressor manages in a noisy room. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Android or Net.Agora.Voice.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is RtcEngine.SetAINSMode in the RTC binding.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
